<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your Login OTP</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #2c3e50; background-color: #ecf0f1; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #2c3e50; color: #ffffff; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #34495e; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .content { padding: 40px 35px; }
    .otp-box { background: #f8f9fa; border: 2px solid #2c3e50; border-radius: 4px; padding: 25px; text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }
    .otp-code { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #2c3e50; letter-spacing: 10px; margin: 15px 0; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
    .warning { background: #fff8e1; border-left: 3px solid #ffa000; padding: 15px 20px; margin: 25px 0; color: #666; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 25px 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #7f8c8d; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 10px 0; }
    li { margin: 5px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      
      <p>You have requested to login to your UniRooms account. Please use the one-time password (OTP) below to complete your authentication:</p>
      
      <div class="otp-box">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #7f8c8d; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">One-Time Password</p>
        <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #95a5a6;">Valid for 10 minutes</p>
      </div>
      
      <p>Please enter this code on the login verification page to access your account.</p>
      
      <div class="warning">
        <strong>Security Notice:</strong><br>
        <ul style="margin: 8px 0;">
          <li>Never share this OTP with anyone, including UniRooms staff</li>
          <li>This code is valid for a single use only</li>
          <li>If you did not request this code, please ignore this email and secure your account</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <p>If you need assistance, please contact our support team at support@pgfinder.com</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The UniRooms Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>UniRooms</strong> - Student Accommodation Platform</p>
      <p>© {{year}} UniRooms. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
